      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Tempo and Pyroscope capture\\n\\n1. Open **Tempo Explore** from the dashboard link. Query orchestration traces with `{ resource.service.name = \\\"order-service-orchestration\\\" }` and choreography traces with `{ resource.service.name = \\\"order-service-choreography\\\" }`. Capture the waterfall as `grafana-trace-waterfall.png`.\\n2. Open **Pyroscope** from the dashboard link and select CPU profile `process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds`. Capture only when a flame graph has visible samples for the run window as `grafana-pyroscope-profile.png`.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "12.1.1"
    },
